-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13322/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13322" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13322"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaspsc1b0/"></a>008</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 69%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13323/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13323" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13323"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasd82xp9/"></a>Мажбуриятлар ва тўловларни таъминлаш &#8212; олинган</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13324/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13324" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13324"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasshpu9y/"></a><strong>БТ</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13325/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13325" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13325"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasw9gwg6/"></a>009</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 69%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13326/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13326" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13326"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasb2xdgl/"></a>Мажбуриятлар ва тўловларни таъминлаш &#8212; берилган</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr13327/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13327" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13327