nchor="/document/90/15191/dfasn1hthq/"></a>4710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 18%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr1902/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1902" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1902"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasrsfog7/"></a>0930</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr1903/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1903" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1903"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas875kdz/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 60%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr1904/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1904" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1904"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas3hvfgk/"></a>Берилган қарзлар бўйича ходимлар қарзларининг узоқ муддатли қисми</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr1905/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1905" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1905"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaso0n0g0/"></a>0930</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 18%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr1906/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1906" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1906"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasg2lk9o/"></a>5110-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr19