<p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3729/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3729" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3729"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasgkubo0/"></a>4830</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3730/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3730" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3730"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasowfgoq/"></a>9530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3731/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3731" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3731"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaseqxoqm/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 61%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3732/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3732" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3732"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasi0kah1/"></a>Мижозлардан келиб тушиши лозим бўлган қуйидаги тўловларнинг ҳисобланиши:</p></td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 18%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3733/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3733" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3733"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas8ub0sl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr3734/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3734" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3734"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasvkl7m5/"></a>&#160;</t