ocument/90/15191/bssPhr14180/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14180" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14180"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas6v3n27/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 67%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr14181/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14181" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14181"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasizbyl5/"></a>Суғурта бўйича қарзларнинг аккредитив маблағлари ҳисобига қопланиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr14182/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14182" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14182"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasay1xk2/"></a>6510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr14183/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14183" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14183"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasrgxzot/"></a>5510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr14184/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14184" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14184"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasgr12s1/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 67%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr14185/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14185" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14185"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfass8v8i1/"></a>