anchor" data-phrase-id="15866" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15866"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasgmhzoa/"></a>4010</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr15867/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15867" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15867"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaskcfidh/"></a>9010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr15868/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15868" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfash3bss2/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 59%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr15869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasbcf0ob/"></a>Маҳсулот, товарлар, ишлар ва хизматлар шуъба ва қарам хўжалик жамиятларига сотилиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr15870/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15870" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15870"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasbnohg2/"></a>4120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr15871/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15871" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15871"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaso34l8v/"></a>9010, 9020, 9030</p