шартномаларини бузганлик учун жарималар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 24.2%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr16909/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16909" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16909"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasfmdg85/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 36.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr16910/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16910" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16910"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasp683nl/"></a>6960</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr16911/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16911" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16911"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfastxgmr2/"></a>22.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr16912/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16912" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16912"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas7qbhur/"></a>Маҳаллий транспортдан фойдаланиш учун йўл ҳужжатлари тўланиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 24.2%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr16913/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16913" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16913"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasds5mpm/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 36.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/docum