yle="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas7zhofm/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17293/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17293" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17293"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasubqi5x/"></a>0310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17294/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17294" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17294"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasu08pn6/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 60%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17295/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17295" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17295"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasv628dx/"></a>Таъсисчиларнинг устав капиталига улуш (пай) сифатида киритилган ёки акцияларга тўлов сифатида келиб тушган асосий воситаларнинг кирим қилиниши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17296/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17296" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17296"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaslk9zuk/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="tex