or" data-phrase-id="17302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas15vbnf/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 60%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasaqaagc/"></a>Асосий воситаларнинг ажратилган бўлинмалар, шуъба ва қарам хўжалик жамиятларидан келиб тушиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17304/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17304" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17304"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasftvudu/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17305/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17305" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17305"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasvdb7ec/"></a>6110, 6120</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17306/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17306" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17306"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasr3zte6/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 60%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17307/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17307" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas44uxen/"></a>Қўшимча қуриш, ускуналар ўрнатиш, модернизация, реконструкция қилиш ва бошқа сифат жиҳатидан яхшилаш натижасида асосий воситалар бошланғич қийматининг кўпайиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17308/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17308" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17308"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasem5y5a/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17309/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17309" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17309"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas4r20p1/"></a>0890</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17310/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17310" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17310"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasoto973/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 60%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17311/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17311" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17311"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaslzwlbp/"></a>Ерни ободонлаштириш билан боғлиқ харажатларни асосий воситалар таркибига киритиш</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-al