-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7314" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7314"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasq0yfaq/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7315/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7315" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7315"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasvqgkzd/"></a>Инвентаризация натижасида тугалланмаган қурилишда камомад суммаси аниқланиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:32.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7316/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7316" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7316"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasei3tvl/"></a>5910</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:36.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7317/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7317" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7317"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas49gezf/"></a>0810</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7318/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7318" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7318"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasx66n2l/"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7319/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7319" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7319"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasf