nchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7448"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasoakzce/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7449/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7449" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7449"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas8hdx20/"></a>Берилган қарзлар бўйича ходимлар қарзларининг узоқ муддатли қисми</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:30.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7450/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7450" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7450"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasehm0d1/"></a>0930</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:36.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7451/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7451" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7451"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfascmqrii/"></a>5110-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7452/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7452" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7452"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasmmvnep/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr7453/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="7453" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr7453"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasbt996o/"></a>Берилган қарзлар бўйича қарзлар суммасининг узоқ муддатли қисмининг жорий қисмиг