ites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9190"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasg9s5nb/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9191/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9191" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9191"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasnmqk8q/"></a>Кредитга олинган товарларнинг тўлови учун ходимлардан келиб тушган навбатдаги тўловлар суммаси</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9192/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9192" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9192"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfass1p6zd/"></a>5010, 5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9193/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9193" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9193"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas0ygeud/"></a>4710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9194/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9194" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9194"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasowy9ph/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9195/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9195" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9195"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas2mt86h/"></a>Кредитга олинган товарлар учун ходимларнинг иш ҳақидан ушлаб қолинган тўловлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9196/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9196" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9196"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasb58qpi/"></a>6710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9197/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9197" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9197"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasu0cepw/"></a>4710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9198/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9198" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9198"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas3tq6w9/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9199/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9199" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9199"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas5m4wa5/"></a>Ходимларга берилган қарзлар суммаси</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9200/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9200" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9200"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas1uc3od/"></a>4720</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9201/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9201" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9201"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaso0vqz3/"></a>5010-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9202/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9202" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9202"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfask2no97/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9203/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9203" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9203"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasc8uesl/"></a>Яроқсиз маҳсулотдан кўрилган йўқотишлар моддий зарарни юзага келтирган айбдор шахслар ҳисобига ҳисобдан чиқарилди</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9204/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9204" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9204"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasgeebz6/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9205/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9205" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9205"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasz4n5ow/"></a>2610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9206/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9206" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9206"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasf3g22c/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9207/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9207" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9207"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas9ldhye/"></a>Асосий воситалар ва номоддий активларнинг камомади учун айбдор шахслардан ундириладиган суммалар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9208/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9208" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9208"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasyuca0w/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9209/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9209" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9209"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaswft8sm/"></a>9210, 9220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9210/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9210" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9210"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasxgtsew/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9211/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9211" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9211"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas8ehwmr/"></a>Қимматли қоғозларнинг камомади учун айбдор шахслардан ундириладиган суммалар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:28.8%;