></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas6k3fol/"></a>Олдин қисқа муддатли инвестициялар тартибида берилган қарзнинг қайтарилиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:32.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9608/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9608" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9608"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasos2ymh/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:34.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9609/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9609" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9609"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas8vl6yh/"></a>5830</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9610/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9610" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9610"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasiuygxw/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9611/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9611" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9611"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasrb400d/"></a>Илгари берилган бўнакларнинг қайтарилиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:32.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr9612/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="9612" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr9612"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasax4wf2/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:34.6%; word-wrap:break-