; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17596/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17596" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17596"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas7z6aw2/"></a>Даъво муддати ўтиши билан кредиторлик қарзларини ҳисобдан чиқарилиши</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17597/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17597" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17597"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasikrg48/"></a>6010</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 26.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17598/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17598" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17598"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfaskei6uh/"></a>9360</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17599/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17599" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17599"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfas5m9z34/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 50%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/15191/bssPhr17600/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="17600" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr17600"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15191/dfasf873vq/"></a>Кредиторлик қарзлар ва бошқаларни ҳисобдан чиқаришдан даромадлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor=